{"id":"n24398-1-3","stage":3,"title":"아깝다 · 可惜","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24398-1-3-1","ko":"시간만 좀 더 있었더라면 비겼을지도 모르는데.","zh":"要是时间能再长一点的话，说不定就能打平了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시간만","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"4","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간만","audio":"/audio/5695ffd32b790c964a97.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"있었더라면","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더라면：假设过去出现另一情况：“要是当时……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었더라면","audio":"/audio/5d422306c99b28ce313e.mp3"}},{"text":"비겼을지도","meaning":"打平，战平","explanation":"비기다：打平，战平；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"비기다","audio":"/audio/d6617b53cd5c3d3a2c5c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25663","senseId":"1","lemma":"비기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비겼을지도","audio":"/audio/37a511f318d09f64ac15.mp3"}},{"text":"모르는데.","meaning":"不知道，不确定，也许","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不确定，也许；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"5","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르는데","audio":"/audio/ee2cc5023edd9bae8925.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"某件事从开始到结束的间隔期间。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"d6617b53cd5c3d3a","term":"비기다","zh":"打平，战平","audio":"/audio/d6617b53cd5c3d3a2c5c.mp3","entryId":"25663","definition":"比赛中得分相同没有分出胜负而结束。","pronunciation":["비기다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不确定，也许","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"推测或猜测不确定的事宜。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/729a92bdd92a49ec0c61.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24398-1-3-2","ko":"맞아, 정말 아깝게 졌어.","zh":"对，真是可惜地输了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아,","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아","audio":"/audio/c92874385c2bbee2ea2e.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"아깝게","meaning":"可惜，心疼","explanation":"아깝다：可惜，心疼；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"아깝다","audio":"/audio/12194e98cc6edbd899e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24398","senseId":"1","lemma":"아깝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아깝게","audio":"/audio/85073eefdfa7bfc4aad0.mp3"}},{"text":"졌어.","meaning":"输","explanation":"지다：输；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63606","senseId":"1","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"졌어","audio":"/audio/ad3d3e2a5157bc68a08d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"12194e98cc6edbd8","term":"아깝다","zh":"可惜，心疼","audio":"/audio/12194e98cc6edbd899e3.mp3","entryId":"24398","definition":"失去了珍贵的东西而感到遗憾。","pronunciation":["아깝따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"输","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"63606","definition":"在比赛或战争中败给对方。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e8b2996fc7d4186122eb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.62,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24398","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":113,"sequenceScore":2.9234,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["要是时间能再长一点的话，说不定就能打平了。","对，真是可惜地输了。","现在还不是很晚，可以再玩一会儿。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["要是时间能再长一点的话，说不定就能打平了。","对，真是可惜地输了。","现在还不是很晚，可以再玩一会儿。"],"answer":1}]}
